  "Description": "COLUMNS + BEAMS: studies the open plan (grids or walls) -> structural columns at crossings / wall junctions / spans and beams connecting them, sizes + spacing + storeys controlled, span / depth check",
  "Name": "B19_MODEL_Structural_Columns_Beams_From_Plan_Grids_Or_Walls",
