        "Background": "#FFB9F9E1"
      },
      {
        "Id": "022d411ba27d415aa34f2db4676bce23",
        "Title": "HOW TO USE:  open the floor plan.  GRIDS = a column at every grid crossing, beams along the grid lines.  WALLS = columns at wall corners, T / X junctions and ends, plus extra columns so no span is longer than 2, kept out of doors / windows (8); walls thinner than 1 are partitions (no columns).  AUTO = grids if the plan has crossing grids, else walls.  Columns from this level to the next (5) or every storey above (6 = ALL); beams at the level above join the columns.  Report: spans + beam depth check (depth >= span / 12).  RUN False = study + counts only.  Run again = replaced (no doubles).",
        "DescriptionText": null,
        "IsExpanded": true,
        "WidthAdjustment": 0.0,
        "HeightAdjustment": 0.0,
        "Nodes": [],
        "HasNestedGroups": false,
        "Left": 0.0,
        "Top": -420.0,
        "Width": 0.0,
        "Height": 0.0,
        "FontSize": 36.0,
        "GroupStyleId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
        "InitialTop": 0.0,
        "InitialHeight": 0.0,
        "TextblockHeight": 0.0,
        "Background": "#FFC1D676"
      }
